            "detailed_description": "<h1>Destaque</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/bda3c2a796d252bee966f0a19f6b3590.avif?t=1790255071\" width=616 height=206 /></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/4bea062dadcb2964488ef465887fdbd2.avif?t=1790255071\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br>Estamos em 1934, nos confins do Pacífico do Sul. Norah atravessou o oceano em busca da expedição perdida do seu marido. Dá por si numa ilha paradisíaca e verdejante, um local esquecido e sem nome, repleto de vestígios de uma civilização perdida.<br><br>Que segredos esconderá? O que encontrará Norah na sua busca pela verdade?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/5d3db27944d6afbbf362a913076383bb.poster.avif?t=1790255071\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/5d3db27944d6afbbf362a913076383bb.webm?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/5d3db27944d6afbbf362a913076383bb.mp4?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/fbbebda56abfcb4ef416d2c023029ec1.avif?t=1790255071\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explora uma ilha tropical fantástica[/*]<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investiga as pistas deixadas pela anterior expedição[/*]<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Entra na pele de uma mulher em busca da verdade acerca do desaparecimento do seu marido e da sua própria identidade. Cissy Jones (Firewatch[/*]<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Descobre uma aventura com uma história cheia de suspense[/*][/list]<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/8b637099f294370c0a777f94ff23e584.poster.avif?t=1790255071\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/8b637099f294370c0a777f94ff23e584.webm?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/8b637099f294370c0a777f94ff23e584.mp4?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/3d987ba3a5d2d293eebea66af928e798.poster.avif?t=1790255071\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/3d987ba3a5d2d293eebea66af928e798.webm?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/3d987ba3a5d2d293eebea66af928e798.mp4?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/4bea062dadcb2964488ef465887fdbd2.avif?t=1790255071\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br>Estamos em 1934, nos confins do Pacífico do Sul. Norah atravessou o oceano em busca da expedição perdida do seu marido. Dá por si numa ilha paradisíaca e verdejante, um local esquecido e sem nome, repleto de vestígios de uma civilização perdida.<br><br>Que segredos esconderá? O que encontrará Norah na sua busca pela verdade?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/5d3db27944d6afbbf362a913076383bb.poster.avif?t=1790255071\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/5d3db27944d6afbbf362a913076383bb.webm?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/5d3db27944d6afbbf362a913076383bb.mp4?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/fbbebda56abfcb4ef416d2c023029ec1.avif?t=1790255071\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explora uma ilha tropical fantástica[/*]<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investiga as pistas deixadas pela anterior expedição[/*]<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Entra na pele de uma mulher em busca da verdade acerca do desaparecimento do seu marido e da sua própria identidade. Cissy Jones (Firewatch[/*]<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Descobre uma aventura com uma história cheia de suspense[/*][/list]<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/8b637099f294370c0a777f94ff23e584.poster.avif?t=1790255071\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/8b637099f294370c0a777f94ff23e584.webm?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/8b637099f294370c0a777f94ff23e584.mp4?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/3d987ba3a5d2d293eebea66af928e798.poster.avif?t=1790255071\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/3d987ba3a5d2d293eebea66af928e798.webm?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042490/extras/3d987ba3a5d2d293eebea66af928e798.mp4?t=1790255071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Descobre uma história de mistério e amor nesta aventura cheia de quebra-cabeças. Explora uma ilha paradisíaca cheia de paisagens deslumbrantes na pele de Norah, uma mulher que sofre de uma doença misteriosa e que está em busca do marido desaparecido.",
